  "ID": "35159",
  "post_title": "Masiva inauguración de la muestra de Ond'Art en el Museu del Taulell",
  "post_date": "2013-03-23 07:54:49",
  "post_name": "masiva-inauguracion-de-la-muestra-de-ondart-en-el-museu-del-taulell",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Centenares de personas han asistido la tarde de este viernes a la ianuguraci&oacute;n de la exposici&oacute;n del <a href=\"http://ondaart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">colectivo multidisciplinar Ond&#39;Art</a> en el Museu del Taulell &#39;Manolo Safont&#39;, que podr&aacute; verse hasta el 21 de abril en el horario de apertura del museo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/03/IMG_9708.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La dise&ntilde;adora, pintora y profesora Begonya Molina Olucha ha ido presentando a las diez personas que componen el colectivo, adem&aacute;s de ella misma: Rosana Mora Corella, Mari Carmen Vidal Casta&ntilde;, Maria &Aacute;lvaro Rovira, Ana Sansano Sansano, Patricia Gorr&iacute;s Flores, Mamen L&oacute;pez S&aacute;nchez, Javier Marcilla Garc&iacute;a, Manolo Aguilella Monta&ntilde;&eacute;s y Antonio Mart&iacute;nez G&oacute;mez.</p>\n<p>El alcalde, Salvador Aguilella Ramos, ha indicado que Ond&#39;Art es una muestra de la vitalidad art&iacute;stica y cultural del municipio.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9670.jpg\" alt=\"img_9670\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9671.jpg\" alt=\"img_9671\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9672.jpg\" alt=\"img_9672\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9673.jpg\" alt=\"img_9673\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9674.jpg\" alt=\"img_9674\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9675.jpg\" alt=\"img_9675\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9676.jpg\" alt=\"img_9676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9677.jpg\" alt=\"img_9677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9678.jpg\" alt=\"img_9678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9679.jpg\" alt=\"img_9679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9680.jpg\" alt=\"img_9680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9681.jpg\" alt=\"img_9681\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9682.jpg\" alt=\"img_9682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9683.jpg\" alt=\"img_9683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9684.jpg\" alt=\"img_9684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9685.jpg\" alt=\"img_9685\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoondartmuseutaulell/img_9686.jpg\" alt=\"img_9686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d